WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: A Prophecy Unfolds (1-02)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: Carnaby Street (1983)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.700
[Arpeggiated Synth Sequence & Rolling Tribal Toms Intro]

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.800
The shadows lengthen on the wall, the sequence has begun

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:41.500
A chill is blowing through the hall, awakening the sun

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:48.500
We read the signs in broken glass, and trace the hidden lines

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.500
Another empty day will pass, another fate declines

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.500
The gears are turning in the dark, above the factory floor

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.800
We try to catch the fading spark, behind the heavy door

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.200
Can you see the prophecy unfold?

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.400
(It's unfolding...)

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:24.200
Shadows in the stories we were told!

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:29.200
Turn the wheel and watch the colours run!

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:36.200
Hiding from the freezing of the sun...

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.500
A prophecy unfolds!

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:46.400
[Synth & Tribal Tom Interlude]

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:52.800
A thousand voices in the wire, a whisper in the screen

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:59.800
We feed the papers to the fire, to keep the engine clean

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:06.800
You lock the gate and turn the key, you try to understand

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:13.800
How anything was meant to be, inside this hollow land

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:20.500
Just two remain against the tide, against the bitter cold

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:28.800
With nowhere left for us to hide, exactly as foretold

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:33.500
Can you see the prophecy unfold?

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.800
(It's unfolding...)

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:42.500
Shadows in the stories we were told!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:47.500
Turn the wheel and watch the colours run!

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:54.500
Hiding from the freezing of the sun...

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:58.000
A prophecy unfolds!

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.000
Is it written in the code?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.800
At the ending of the road?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.200
We are running out of time!

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.000
We are running out of time!

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:45.600
[Swirling Analog Synthesizer Solo]

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:50.200
Can you see the prophecy unfold?

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.600
(It's unfolding...)

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:59.500
Shadows in the stories we were told!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:04.500
Turn the wheel and watch the colours run!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:11.200
Hiding from the freezing of the sun...

